    "description": "2022 - Present: lead the team building security features for HPE's Alletra Storage MP X10000 platform\n\n2021 - 2022: low level disk encryption for highly distributed scalable cluster: LUKS2, distributed KEK management using trusted hardware TPM2\n\n2019 - 2020: Security: Single Sign-On, Identity and Access Management for a cloud-based data management platform for all HPE appliances.\n\n2016-2018: High Availability: Cluster Management, Automatic Failover\n  • Distributed quorum-based  I/O\n  • Automatic failover for 3-node cluster: active/standby nodes and a witness, distributed state machine, network heartbeat\n\n2014-2016: Security: Encryption, Authentication, Authorization\n  • User management/authentication/authorization\n  • Key management server for Encryption at Rest disk storage\n  • RBAC (Role-Based Access Control) for REST APIs\n  • PAM (Pluggable Authentication Module)",
